.TH NEO-MESSAGING 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-messaging \- messaging app for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-messaging
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Messaging app rebuilt in GTK 4 for SMS: conversations, the composer, forwarding, archiving and blocked contacts. It is D-Bus activatable as neo.Messaging and opens sms: and smsto: links.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-messaging-sms(1)
